dealer  S

# seat hand             | auction              | expect | why
N 82.QJ973.K94.J83      | 1NT P                | 2D     | weak, five hearts
N QJ973.82.K94.J83      | 1NT P                | 2H     | five spades
N 82.KQ9732.A94.KQ      | 1NT P                | 2D     | mild slam interest (15 suit points): transfer, then jump to game
