S AK5.Q72.Q942.K83      | 1NT P 2D P           | !P     | the transfer is forcing, even with a minimum

# Responder's rebid. Notrump decisions count total points, the fifth
# card of the major included (+1 a card beyond four); playing in the major
# counts suit points (+½ a card beyond four).
N 82.QJ973.J94.J83      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P      | P      | 5 HCP + 1 length = 6: sign off
N 82.QJ973.K94.J83      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P      | 2NT    | 7 HCP + 1 length = 8: invite (responder counts length)
N 82.KJ973.K94.Q83      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P      | 3NT    | 9 HCP + 1 length = 10: game, offering the choice
N 82.QJ9732.K94.Q8      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P      | 3H     | 8 HCP + 1 length = 9 points: invite
N 82.KJ973.K94.AQ3      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P      | 3NT    | 13, five hearts: choice of games
N 82.KJ9732.K94.A8      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P      | 4H     | 13, six hearts
N 82.KJ9732.K94.Q8      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P      | 4H     | 9 HCP + 1 length = 10 points: game, not an invite
N 8.KJ973.K4.AQ832      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P      | 3C     | second suit, game forcing
N 82.KQ9732.A94.KQ      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P      | 4H     | mild slam interest: jump to game
N KJ973.82.K94.Q83      | 1NT P 2H P 2S P      | 3NT    | the same rules over spades
N QJ973.82.K94.J83      | 1NT P 2H P 2S P      | 2NT    | 7 HCP + 1 length: invite
N Q65.AK653.AT.AQ5      | 1NT P                | 2D     | 19 with five hearts: transfer first, not 6NT
N Q65.AK653.AT.AQ5      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P      | 6NT    | then slam
N Q65.AK653.J3.KQ5      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P      | 4NT    | 15 HCP + 1 length = 16: quantitative
N 82.KJ973.K94.Q83      | 1NT P 2D P 2NT P     | 4H     | after a maximum super-accept, 9 is a game hand
N AT984.KT.954.874      | 1NT P 2H P 2NT P     | 3S     | 7½ suit points: sign off; never pass the artificial 2NT
N J82.Q8652.J4.A83      | 1NT P 2D P 2NT P     | 4H     | 8½ suit points opposite a maximum: game
N Q8542.T86.43.A65      | 1NT P 2H P 2NT P     | 3S     | 6 HCP: sign off in the fit, never pass the artificial 2NT (1N board 284)

