S KQ53.KJ.AQ53.J52      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P 2NT P | P     | 16 without a fit: 3NT needs 17
S KQ53.KJ.AK53.J52      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P 2NT P | 3NT   | 17, two hearts
S KQ53.KJ.AQ53.T52      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P 2NT P | P     | 15, two hearts
S KQ53.KJ.AK53.J52      | 1NT P 2D P 2H P 3H P  | 4H    | 3H showed six: two-card support is a fit

# Opener after responder's jump to 4M (mild slam interest).
